OL,3,GNEWSAShopfront badly damaged in
OL,4,Aram-raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car crashed into the front of a shop
OL,7,Fin Leicester before items were stolen
OL,8,Fduring a ram-raid.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said a group of
OL,11,Fmen drove a red Ford Fiesta into the
OL,12,Ffront of the Cash Generator store in
OL,13,FSaffron Lane shortly after 03:00 BST on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FOfficers believe three men then entered
OL,17,Fthe store and stole a number of mobile
OL,18,Fphones and games consoles.
OL,20,FThe men left the scene on a motorbike
OL,21,Fand headed in the direction of the Pork
OL,22,FPie roundabout, the force said.
